@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.RotiArumModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "C1nta for Rot1 Arum";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <!-- BACK -->
        <div class="back-top reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Collaborations">← Back</a>
        </div>

        <!-- HERO -->
        <div class="event-hero reveal">
            <div class="event-hero-text">
                <p class="eyebrow">Collaborations & Campaigns</p>
                <h2>C1nta for Rot1 Arum</h2>

                <p class="event-intro">
                    A collaboration created for Rot1 Arum’s first anniversary,
                    where celebration became a space to share appreciation,
                    awareness, and connection.
                </p>

                <div class="event-tags">
                    <span>Collaboration</span>
                    <span>Anniversary</span>
                    <span>Awareness</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="event-hero-img">
                <img src="/images/roti-arum/1.jpg" alt="C1nta for Rot1 Arum">
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- OPENING -->
        <div class="hbii-quote reveal">
            <p>
                Every journey deserves to be celebrated —
                and for us, celebration becomes even more meaningful
                when it is shared.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 1 -->
        <div class="hbii-block reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">A Moment Worth Celebrating</p>
                <h3>Joining a Meaningful Milestone</h3>

                <p>
                    Every journey has its own moment to be celebrated.
                    For us, celebration is never only about the event itself,
                    but about how meaning can be shared within it.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Through <em>C1nta for Rot1 Arum</em>, we were honored to be part of
                    a special milestone: Rot1 Arum’s first anniversary.
                </p>

                <p>
                    It was not only a festive moment,
                    but also a chance to bring warmth, appreciation,
                    and a different kind of experience into the celebration.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-block-card">
                <h4>What This Collaboration Brought</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Celebration with meaning</li>
                    <li>A shared customer experience</li>
                    <li>Sign language interaction</li>
                    <li>Awareness through participation</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- IMAGE BREAK -->
        <div class="featured-grid reveal">
            <img src="/images/roti-arum/2.jpg" alt="Rot1 Arum anniversary moment">
            <img src="/images/roti-arum/3.jpg" alt="Customers interacting at the event">
            <img src="/images/roti-arum/4.jpg" alt="Kopi Cinta at Rot1 Arum">
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 2 -->
        <div class="hbii-feature reveal">
            <div class="hbii-feature-card">
                <p class="hbii-label">Sharing Love, Together</p>
                <h3>A Celebration Shared with Everyone</h3>

                <p>
                    On that joyful day, we wanted to share LOVE—
                    not only with Arumania and customers,
                    but also with the team behind Rot1 Arum
                    who made the journey possible.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Because for us, every celebration feels more meaningful
                    when it is experienced together.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-feature-card soft">
                <p class="hbii-label">A Cup of Connection</p>
                <h3>Ordering in a Different Way</h3>

                <p>
                    We offered a special Kopi Cinta free of charge
                    as a small gesture of appreciation and joy.
                </p>

                <p>
                    But as always, we invited everyone to order in a different way:
                    through sign language.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 3 -->
        <div class="kbi-section reveal">
            <div class="kbi-img">
                <img src="/images/roti-arum/5.jpg" alt="Ordering through sign language">
            </div>

            <div class="kbi-text">
                <h3>Not Just a Requirement, But an Experience</h3>

                <p>
                    Ordering through sign language was never meant to be only a condition.
                    It was meant to be an experience.
                </p>

                <p>
                    A space to learn, to try,
                    and to connect beyond spoken words.
                </p>

                <p>
                    In that simple act,
                    people were invited to step into a new way of interacting—
                    one that opened room for curiosity, empathy, and understanding.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 4 -->
        <div class="hbii-block reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">More Than a Celebration</p>
                <h3>Where Joy Meets Meaning</h3>

                <p>
                    <em>C1nta for Rot1 Arum</em> was never just about marking an anniversary.
                </p>

                <p>
                    It was about bringing together two simple things:
                    celebration and meaning.
                </p>

                <p>
                    A happy moment became a space
                    to share awareness and expand how we understand one another.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-highlight-panel">
                <div>
                    <strong>Celebrate</strong>
                    <span>A milestone worth sharing</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Learn</strong>
                    <span>Try a different way to communicate</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <strong>Connect</strong>
                    <span>Find warmth beyond words</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CLOSING -->
        <div class="hbii-ending reveal">
            <h3>Happy 1st Anniversary, Rot1 Arum</h3>

            <p>
                May this journey continue to grow,
                bringing joy and inspiration to many more people ahead.
            </p>

            <p>
                And for us,
                thank you for letting us be part of a moment worth celebrating.
            </p>

            <p>
                Because in the end,
                love always feels warmer when it is shared.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- GALLERY -->
        <div class="detail-section reveal">
            <h3 style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Gallery</h3>

            <div class="gallery-grid">
                @for (int i = 1; i <= 10; i++)
                {
                    <img src="/images/roti-arum/@(i).jpg" class="gallery-img" alt="C1nta for Rot1 Arum event" />
                }
            </div>
        </div>
        <br />
        <!-- BACK -->
        <div class="detail-back reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Collaborations" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Collaborations</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>